    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a witch\u2019s canine familiar tasked with saving magical creatures and solving a mystery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Herdles walks the line between an epic adventure and a puzzle platformer, using barking as the main mechanic of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dynamic environment of lush hills and forests that get increasingly more magical as the game progresses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no combat or death, instead you are offered multiple humorous and puzzly solutions to deal with adversaries in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Bark Changes Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything reacts to your bark. Reveal secrets, trigger mechanisms, and explore an interactive world full of magic and wonder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/aab1e8583c736817d772691f4c2db90c.poster.avif?t=1745393209\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/aab1e8583c736817d772691f4c2db90c.webm?t=1745393209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/aab1e8583c736817d772691f4c2db90c.mp4?t=1745393209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Roads Lead To Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple ways to progress through the world. Experiment and think out of the box to find the most efficient and/or funniest solutions to any obstacle you might face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/e495f89f63a6cfdf18b174f9caa5d7d3.poster.avif?t=1745393209\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/e495f89f63a6cfdf18b174f9caa5d7d3.webm?t=1745393209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/e495f89f63a6cfdf18b174f9caa5d7d3.mp4?t=1745393209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Hurdles, Just Herdles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Herdles has a strong focus on modern accessibility and offers settings to accommodate people with various disabilities, but also includes a variety of options that change the game itself. Tune the game to your needs/preferences and play it as a challenging parkour with lots of dangers or as a cozy experience without conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a witch\u2019s canine familiar tasked with saving magical creatures and solving a mystery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Herdles walks the line between an epic adventure and a puzzle platformer, using barking as the main mechanic of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dynamic environment of lush hills and forests that get increasingly more magical as the game progresses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no combat or death, instead you are offered multiple humorous and puzzly solutions to deal with adversaries in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Bark Changes Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything reacts to your bark. Reveal secrets, trigger mechanisms, and explore an interactive world full of magic and wonder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/aab1e8583c736817d772691f4c2db90c.poster.avif?t=1745393209\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/aab1e8583c736817d772691f4c2db90c.webm?t=1745393209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/aab1e8583c736817d772691f4c2db90c.mp4?t=1745393209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Roads Lead To Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple ways to progress through the world. Experiment and think out of the box to find the most efficient and/or funniest solutions to any obstacle you might face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/e495f89f63a6cfdf18b174f9caa5d7d3.poster.avif?t=1745393209\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/e495f89f63a6cfdf18b174f9caa5d7d3.webm?t=1745393209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/e495f89f63a6cfdf18b174f9caa5d7d3.mp4?t=1745393209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Hurdles, Just Herdles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Herdles has a strong focus on modern accessibility and offers settings to accommodate people with various disabilities, but also includes a variety of options that change the game itself. Tune the game to your needs/preferences and play it as a challenging parkour with lots of dangers or as a cozy experience without conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a magical dogventure! Jump, run, and bark through a vibrant world and ethereal dungeons. Rescue Herdles and use their abilities to unleash your creativity and restore the balance - one bark at a time!",
